 R←Test_SendEmail_10(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;parms;rc;msg;log;text
⍝ Send the most simple HTML email
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 parms←∆NewMail'Created by SMTP''s ',⊃⎕SI
 parms.Body←'<html>' '<body>' '<p>A <b>bold</b> word.</p>' '</body>' '</html>'
 (rc msg log text)←∆Send parms
 →T.PassesIf 0=rc
 →T.PassesIf'text/html; charset="UTF-8"'≡text ∆Header'Content-Type'
 →T.PassesIf(⊂'<p>A <b>bold</b> word.</p>')∊SMTP.Message.SplitLines text

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
